<noinclude>
Infobox and Cargo row for a class. Create pages with [[Form:Class]].
Each system it exists in is a [[Template:Class system]] row inside <code>in_systems</code>, which sets the lists the stat blocks pick from.
[[Module:Species]] lists each system once, and flags repeats in [[:Category:Classes with repeated systems]].

{{#cargo_declare:_table=Classes
|image=File
|summary=Text
}}

